OL,3,ATrump lands in Asia ahead of talks with
OL,4,ARussian and Chinese presidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Trump has arrived in the
OL,7,FPhilippines' capital on the first leg
OL,8,Fof a trip to Asia, which will end in a
OL,9,Fmeeting in China with its President Xi
OL,10,FJinping and his Russian counterpart
OL,11,FVladimir Putin.
OL,13,FA red carpet was rolled out for Trump
OL,14,Fas he walked off Air Force One in
OL,15,FManila. A band played one of his
OL,16,Ffavourite songs, Y.M.C.A., before he
OL,17,Fwas whisked away by helicopter to a
OL,18,Fhotel.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
