OL,3,ATrump lands in Asia ahead of talks with
OL,4,ARussian and Chinese presidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump's first meeting at the Asean
OL,7,FSummit was with America's partners in
OL,8,Fthe Quad - India's Narendra Modi, whom
OL,9,Fhe described as a "very tough man",
OL,10,FJapan's Sanae Takaichi, who "may be
OL,11,Feven tougher", and Australia's Anthony
OL,12,FAlbanese.
OL,14,F"Our countries are the four corners of
OL,15,Fthe free, open, stable, prosperous
OL,16,FIndo-Pacific," the US president said.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
